## Firebase config — google-services.json/GoogleService-Info.plist are low-sensitivity
## (client-side, scoped by package name/bundle ID) but keeping them out of a public-adjacent
## repo is the safer default; a service-account key is a real secret and must never be committed.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

